#: includes/class-ysec-database-safety.php:19
msgid ""
"A WordPress account with the login name “admin” exists. Consider a less predictable administrator"
" login after confirming ownership and recovery paths."
msgstr "存在登入名為“admin”的 WordPress 帳戶。確認所有權和恢復路徑後，建議改用更難預測的管理員登入名。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:2028
msgid ""
"A cache-compatible local form proof rejects direct wp-comments-post.php automation that never "
"rendered the site form. The existing honeypot and optional bounded source-rate policy add "
"independent signals. No external account or reputation service is required."
msgstr "兼容快取的本地表單驗證證據會拒絕從未渲染網站表單卻直接自動調用 wp-comments-post.php 的請求。現有蜜罐和可選的有界來源速率策略提供獨立信號。無需外部帳戶或信譽服務。"

#: includes/class-ysec-takeover.php:66
msgid "A clean install already has a direct YSec ownership path."
msgstr "全新安裝已具備直接的 YSec 所有權路徑。"

#: includes/class-ysec-doctor.php:86
msgid ""
"A configured AI account should expose either a selected model, Writer default or usable text-"
"model catalog."
msgstr "已設定的 AI 帳戶應提供已選模型、Writer 預設模型或可用的文本模型目錄。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:575
msgid ""
"A historical request denial remains immutable evidence. “Unblock source” removes current full-"
"source containment. “Allow exact request” creates a reversible method+path exception for "
"automatic profile matching only. “False positive” and “Mark reviewed” change evidence disposition"
" without erasing history."
msgstr "歷史請求拒絕仍是不可變證據。“解除來源封鎖”會移除當前整來源隔離。“允許精確請求”僅為自動設定檔匹配創建可撤銷的方法+路徑例外。“誤報”和“標記已檢視”只改變證據處置狀態，不會抹除歷史。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1916
msgid ""
"A new policy cannot jump directly from Off to Enforce. YSec first keeps it in Report-Only so real"
" browser behavior can be reviewed."
msgstr "新策略不能直接從“關閉”跳到“強制套用”。YSec 會先保持“僅報告”，以便檢視真實瀏覽器行為。"

#: includes/class-ysec-managed-mu.php:170
msgid "A non-YSec file already uses the managed MU loader filename. YSec will not overwrite it."
msgstr "某個非 YSec 檔案已佔用托管 MU 載入器檔案名。YSec 不會覆蓋它。"

#: includes/class-ysec-firewall-proof.php:142
msgid "A real same-site HTTP request reached YSec and was denied by the application firewall."
msgstr "一個真實的同站 HTTP 請求已到達 YSec，並被應用防火牆拒絕。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1657
msgid ""
"A single local clamd service can serve multiple local WordPress sites on the same host when their"
" PHP runtimes can reach its Unix socket. YSec does not require a mail server or an external "
"malware API."
msgstr "當各網站的 PHP 運行時能夠存取其 Unix 套接字時，一個本地 clamd 服務即可為同一主機上的多個本地 WordPress 網站服務。YSec 不需要電子郵件伺服器或外部惡意軟體 API。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1114
msgid "A temporary ZIP file could not be created."
msgstr "無法創建暫時 ZIP 檔案。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1574
msgid ""
"A thin managed MU bridge applies deterministic local security rules at the earliest WordPress "
"stage while preserving discovery-friendly public traffic."
msgstr "輕量級托管 MU 橋接會在最早的 WordPress 階段應用確定性的本地安全規則，同時保留有利於發現的公共流量。"

