#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:224
msgid ""
"Administrator-managed durable policy. Source allow entries provide explicit trusted access, "
"permanent block entries stop the source before WordPress routing, and exact request exceptions "
"scope automatic profile matching. Smart adaptive response stays in its adaptive layer, while this"
" section remains fully administrator-controlled with self-lockout protection."
msgstr ""
"由管理員管理的持久策略。來源允許項提供明確的可信存取，永久封鎖項會在 WordPress "
"路由前攔截來源，精確請求例外限定自動設定檔匹配。智慧自適應響應仍在自適應層中，而本節完全由管理員控制，並帶有防自鎖保護。"

