#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1762
msgid ""
"YSec never unpacks a repair archive over the live site. Candidates are validated against the "
"original site, path and SHA-256, rescanned, encrypted in staging, and only then become ready for "
"explicit replacement."
msgstr "YSec 絕不會把修復歸檔直接解壓到即時網站上。候選會根據原始網站、路徑和 SHA-256 進行驗證、重新掃描、在暫存區加密，之後才會準備好供顯式替換。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:210
